  "description": "Gobardhan Panda, a self-taught anthropologist from Koraput, Odisha, India, points to parts of the body and names them in Bonda. Prateek Pattanaik recorded it in 2018 for Remosam, a 2019 documentary by Subhashish Panigrahi. The footage wasn't used in the film, and it was edited and published under the Munaremo project in 2024. Subtitles are by Subhashish Panigrahi, using Panda's 1998 book Remosam as a reference.",
